sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ENGINE as Inspection Engine
    participant SQLITE as Local SQLite DB
    participant CACHE as Local Image Disk
    participant SYNC as Edge Sync Daemon
    participant API as Central Backend API
    participant PG as Central PostgreSQL DB
    participant S3 as Central Object Storage

    Note over ENGINE,CACHE: Normal Local Operation (Independent of Internet Link)
    ENGINE->>SQLITE: Insert Defect & Uninspected Records (sync_status = 'PENDING')
    ENGINE->>CACHE: Save Defect Thumbnail & Snippet Images (local_path)
    SQLITE-->>ENGINE: Transaction Committed (Zero Latency on Shop Floor)

    loop Periodic Health Check (Every 5 seconds)
        SYNC->>API: HTTPS GET /api/v1/health (Heartbeat Probe)
        alt Network Outage / Factory Wi-Fi Disconnected
            API--xSYNC: Connection Refused / Timeout
            Note over SYNC: Internet Offline: Buffer records locally.<br/>Edge inspection proceeds unhindered.
        else Network Link Restored / Healthy
            API-->>SYNC: 200 OK (Backend Healthy)
            SYNC->>SQLITE: Fetch Oldest Unsynced Records (LIMIT 50, status = 'PENDING')
            SQLITE-->>SYNC: Return Batch of Transactions {batch_id, records}
            SYNC->>CACHE: Read Associated Image Byte Blobs
            CACHE-->>SYNC: Return Image Streams
            
            SYNC->>API: HTTPS POST /api/v1/sync/batch (Multipart / Gzipped JSON + Images)
            
            rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
                Note over API,S3: Atomic Central Ingestion
                API->>PG: Upsert Records Using UUIDv4 (Idempotent Deduplication)
                API->>S3: PutObject (Store Defect Image Files)
                S3-->>API: Image URLs Generated
                API->>PG: Commit Transaction & Update Cloud Roll Defect Map
                PG-->>API: Commit Successful
            end

            API-->>SYNC: 200 OK (Batch Acknowledged: {synced_ids: [1, 2, ...]})
            SYNC->>SQLITE: UPDATE sync_queue SET status = 'SYNCED' WHERE id IN (...)
            SQLITE-->>SYNC: Rows Updated
            SYNC->>CACHE: Clean / Evict Uploaded Images (Apply Retention Quota)
            Note over SYNC: Sync complete. Ready for next pending chunk.
        end
    end

